===Noun===
{{wikipedia|Casting (falconry)}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# The act or process of selecting actors, singers, dancers, models, etc.
# A manufacturing process using a [[mold]].
# An object made in a mold.
# The [[regurgitation]] of [[fur]], [[feather]]s, and other [[undigestible]] material by [[hawk]]s, to clean and empty their [[crop]]s.
# The [[excreta]] of an [[earthworm]] or similar creature.
# {{lb|en|programming}} The act of converting between data types.

